{"version":1,"content":"<p>消委會今日（15日）宣布，隨著讀者習慣轉變，《選擇》月刊本月出版第600期印刷版將為最後一本紙本版，並將於12月6日舉行啟動禮，推出「選擇資訊通」流動應用程式，展示《選擇》月刊的測試報告和文章外，並會加入個人化內容推送、「我的書架」等新功能。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.269363+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:15:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:57:43.722216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416321+00:00","content_hash":"f30ea3bfea21b99b339fff418613aeb1a50f9176a060fd1425b0077f02cec71a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}